				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:35:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:32:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・時間が午前に話しかけた時</Comment>
